  "description": "Connects the OASIS to Cardano -- a peer-reviewed, research-first proof-of-stake blockchain with Ouroboros consensus and Plutus smart contracts. Stores OASIS holons, avatars, and metadata on Cardano with energy-efficient PoS security. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one",
